Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:10.00,zhu,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}本字幕由豌豆字幕組製作 僅供學習交流 禁止用於商業用途
Comment: 0,0:03:07.96,0:03:08.00,op-jp,,0,0,0,,==========OP==========
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.74,0:03:17.09,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}ねえ その手で壊して 不条理な運命
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.64,0:03:31.51,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}飲み込まれた 怪物の胃袋
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.26,0:03:39.70,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}あれからずっと 絡みつく錆びた鎖
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.70,0:03:47.36,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}気づかずにいたなら 闇でも怖くなかった
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.36,0:03:55.63,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}ねえ その手で壊して 不条理な運命
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.98,0:04:10.59,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}切り裂いてその剣で 本当の世界見せて
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.59,0:04:22.36,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}猛毒に溶け出して 私でなくなる前に
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.46,0:04:31.04,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}さぁ その手で壊して 千切れない罪と私を
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.04,0:04:38.13,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}二度ともう戻れない 不条理な目覚めね
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.13,0:04:45.80,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}さぁ その手で壊して 奈落へと連れて行って
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.80,0:04:50.32,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}もう忘れない まだ痛い
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.32,0:04:53.73,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,0)}君のこと ケシたい
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.74,0:03:17.09,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}親手去打破吧 這不公的命運
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.64,0:03:31.51,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}被怪物吞食 落入胃中
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.26,0:03:39.70,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}從那之後 始終身纏生鏽鎖鏈
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.70,0:03:47.36,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}若視而不見 則不畏黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.36,0:03:55.63,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}親手去打破吧 這不公的命運
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.98,0:04:10.59,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}用那把劍披荊斬棘 讓我看到真實的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.59,0:04:22.36,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}在我被劇毒溶解 失去自我之前
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.46,0:04:31.04,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}親手去打破吧 將我與罪孽分離
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.04,0:04:38.13,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}再也無法回頭 這殘酷的甦醒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.13,0:04:45.80,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}親手去打破吧 將我帶入地獄深淵
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.80,0:04:50.32,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}無法遺忘 痛無止境
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.32,0:04:53.73,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,0)}只想將你 一筆抹消
Comment: 0,0:21:40.95,0:21:40.99,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,==========ED==========
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.40,0:22:04.25,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}ワルツを踊る
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.25,0:22:10.93,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}この世界でどうか手を離さずに
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.93,0:22:16.24,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}何度となく 行き交うかなしい
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.24,0:22:19.91,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}愛しさを躱さずに
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.91,0:22:25.93,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}いつしか秘密が普通へと変わり果てても
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.93,0:22:32.92,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}僕らは期待していられるかな ねえ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.92,0:22:37.49,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}強がってなくちゃ崩れきって消える
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.49,0:22:42.67,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}魔法とすら呼べないこの願いを
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.67,0:22:47.09,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}「捨てた方が楽」 多分そうだとして
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.09,0:22:51.42,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}それでも絶え間なく螺旋を描く
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.42,0:22:56.73,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}僕らは 恐れを振り解き 幕は開けて来た
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.73,0:23:01.90,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}あの過去はいまと共に在ることを
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.90,0:23:06.23,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}「忘れた方が楽」 たとえそうだとして
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.23,0:23:12.56,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}それでも絶え間なく螺旋を描く
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.48,0:23:20.14,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}僕らのワルツ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.14,0:23:26.68,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}僕らのワルツ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.40,0:22:04.25,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}跳起華爾茲
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.25,0:22:10.93,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}在這個世界 請不要鬆開這雙手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.93,0:22:16.24,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}一次又一次 悲傷交匯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.24,0:22:19.91,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}請不要迴避這份愛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.91,0:22:25.93,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}不知不覺中 秘密已化為尋常
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.93,0:22:32.92,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}我們是否還能心懷期待呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.92,0:22:37.49,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}若不故作堅強 便會崩塌消失
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.49,0:22:42.67,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}這無法稱為魔法的祈願
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.67,0:22:47.09,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}即使將其捨棄才更輕鬆
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.09,0:22:51.42,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}也依舊無止境地描繪螺旋
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.42,0:22:56.73,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}我們拋開恐懼 大幕漸起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.73,0:23:01.90,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}那段過去如今也與我們同在
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.90,0:23:06.23,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}即使將其忘卻才更輕鬆
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.23,0:23:12.56,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}也依舊無止境地描繪螺旋
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.48,0:23:20.14,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}我們的華爾茲
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.14,0:23:26.68,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}我們的華爾茲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.98,0:00:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡 逃進森林裡去了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.81,0:00:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,就是要多逃一逃 才有打獵的趣味
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.37,0:00:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我們走
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.14,0:00:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.43,0:00:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.23,0:00:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,被詛咒的森林吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.63,0:00:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,迷信而已 你難道還真信？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.51,0:00:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不信呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.97,0:00:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,滾出去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.72,0:00:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,這是狼人守護的森林
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.97,0:00:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,要是被狼人發現 將受到詛咒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.38,0:00:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好嚇人 那老太太怎麼回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.60,0:00:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道 痴呆了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.28,0:01:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,繼續往前走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.58,0:01:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.57,0:01:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,蠢貨
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.00,0:01:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.58,0:01:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,狐狸在哪裡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.66,0:01:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,狗怎麼在低吼…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.38,0:01:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,那 那是什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.88,0:01:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我哪知道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.34,0:01:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,剛 剛才那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.05,0:01:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,難道是…狼人…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.84,0:01:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,萊納特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.21,0:01:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,歡迎回來
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.96,0:01:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,是你啊 嚇我一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.63,0:02:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,狩獵的收穫如何啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.43,0:02:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,咦？萊納特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.15,0:02:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,您流鼻血了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.23,0:02:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,萊納特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.68,0:02:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 怎麼了 振作點啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.27,0:02:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,怎 怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.29,0:02:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,萊納特 振作點啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.90,0:02:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,布里格先生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.85,0:02:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,「幸會」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.61,0:02:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ich freue mich, Sie kennenzulernen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.79,0:02:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕透了 發音很難聽
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.35,0:02:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,再來一次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.95,0:02:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ich freue mich, Sie kennenzulernen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.44,0:03:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,再來一次
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.87,0:03:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ich freue mich, Sie kennenzulernen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.45,0:05:13.38,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准雅宋_GBK\blur3\fsp5\fscx95\bord0.5\fs50\b1\3c&H000000&\3a&H6E&\fad(516,522)\pos(1617,892)}那位執事 探訪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.43,0:05:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ich freue mich, Sie kennenzulernen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.88,0:05:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了 快暈了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.32,0:05:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,真是不像樣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.38,0:05:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我不擅長德語的發音
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.07,0:05:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,反正能看懂 這不就行了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.10,0:05:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,德國…嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.73,0:05:35.44,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fad(519,0)\fs47\bord3\pos(599.67,970.33)}今日甜點 核桃蛋糕配咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.76,0:05:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,對 德國發生了離奇死亡案
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.99,0:05:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,女王命令我去調查
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.03,0:05:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,要您親自前往嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.28,0:05:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,凡多姆海伍家的使命是管理英國地下社會
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.27,0:05:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,然而 為什麼還要被派到德國去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.16,0:05:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,親愛的小弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.90,0:06:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,德國南部接連有人離奇死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.60,0:06:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,身體健康的人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.77,0:06:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,某一天突然變得相貌畸形 隨後喪命
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.06,0:06:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,德國是威廉…我外孫統治的國家
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.83,0:06:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,也是我家人的故鄉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.63,0:06:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是傳染病 我會立刻派出醫療援助
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.63,0:06:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,但威利和德國政府 都沒有給出明確答覆
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.74,0:06:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我非常擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.11,0:06:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,德國沒有答覆 也就無法公開派遣使者
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.78,0:06:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,便決定派您前往了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.63,0:06:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,以前也有一次追查案件追到了國外
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.77,0:06:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,但我不明白為什麼這次要特地派我出國
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.19,0:06:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,要不要詢問一下明確的理由呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.24,0:06:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,反正肯定會被糊弄過去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.37,0:07:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,作為看門狗 只需要屁顛屁顛追著骨頭跑就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.41,0:07:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,凡多姆海伍家的情報網
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.57,0:07:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,遍佈歐洲和亞洲的地下社會
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.08,0:07:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,陛下也可能是想依靠這些情報
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.39,0:07:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,而且 德國還有前任當家時期就有交往的那個人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.77,0:07:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,派克勞斯去見那個人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.52,0:07:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你去聯繫
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.94,0:07:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.65,0:07:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,好久不見了啊 克勞斯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.00,0:07:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 突然委託你工作
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.54,0:07:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,沒關係的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.70,0:07:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不過 你的執事還真是神出鬼沒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.98,0:07:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好久不見了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.48,0:07:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我正在芬蘭蒸桑拿
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.79,0:07:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,結果他突然出現 嚇了我一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.60,0:07:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,多有冒犯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.50,0:07:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,還好你這次的旅行地就在不遠處
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.72,0:07:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,畢竟之前有一次 你竟跑到地球另一側去了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.86,0:08:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,老人唯一的樂趣就是旅行了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.77,0:08:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.94,0:08:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,事不宜遲
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.95,0:08:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,說說您想聽的 我在德國的見聞
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.65,0:08:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我剛到德國就立刻去見那人了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.95,0:08:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,可他說很忙 不願見我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.86,0:08:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,無奈之下 我便親自去了事發地
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.36,0:08:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是個窮鄉僻壤 折騰死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.47,0:08:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我去拜訪了出現死者的村子和人家
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.52,0:08:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,但並沒有傳染病流行的跡象
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.99,0:08:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,而且死者沒有舊疾 也沒有受傷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.61,0:08:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,於是我詢問了死因
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.96,0:08:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,結果每個人都回答說
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.23,0:08:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,「是魔女的詛咒」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.27,0:08:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,魔女？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.52,0:08:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,死者的年齡和性別各異 但有一個共同點
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.39,0:08:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他們在死亡前 都去過一座森林
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.47,0:08:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,伐烏魯夫森林
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.72,0:09:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,在當地被稱為魔域或者禁區
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.34,0:09:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,就是座神乎其神的森林
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.52,0:09:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,伐烏魯夫…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.14,0:09:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,意思是…狼人森林？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.00,0:09:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,對
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.21,0:09:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,14到17世紀 德國南部發生過慘烈的魔女狩獵
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.47,0:09:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,倖存下來的魔女 逃到了一座森林裡定居
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.93,0:09:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,她們為了保護自己
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.56,0:09:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,便在森林裡放出了使魔 也就是狼人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.95,0:09:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,自那以後 森林就被稱為伐烏魯夫森林
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.95,0:09:31.63,zhu-2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1237.34,980)}狼人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.82,0:09:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,並有了踏入森林就會被魔女詛咒的傳聞
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.91,0:09:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,詛咒能殺人？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.27,0:09:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,簡直荒唐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.75,0:09:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道你會這麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.88,0:09:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉啊 只獲得了這種情報
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.65,0:09:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.93,0:09:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我才要道歉 辛苦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.91,0:09:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,看來還是只能親自去一趟了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.59,0:09:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,另外 還有一件事想問你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.59,0:10:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,葬儀屋失蹤了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.27,0:10:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,他啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.00,0:10:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你從前任當家時期就和他有來往
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.59,0:10:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,應該比我更了解他
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.24,0:10:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼都好 我需要情報
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.78,0:10:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,可惜我們幾乎不會互相干涉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.98,0:10:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,而且 前任當家…文森特
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.98,0:10:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,在認識我之前 就已經認識葬儀屋了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.45,0:10:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,而在葬儀屋之前認識文森特的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.48,0:10:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,也就只有那人了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.68,0:10:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,畢竟他們從上學時就認識了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.88,0:10:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼執行任務時 是否要順道拜訪一下那位呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.64,0:10:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,剛好要去德國
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.11,0:10:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,這是個好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.93,0:10:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,但那個德國美人…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.72,0:10:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不 前美人的防守很堅固
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.75,0:10:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你可要想辦法攻陷他哦 少年
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.08,0:10:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,只能祈禱我去找他的時候 他心情很好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.44,0:11:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,塞巴斯蒂安 去準備車票
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.27,0:11:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes my lord
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.81,0:11:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,受不了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.34,0:11:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼父子倆都這麼會給人找麻煩
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.08,0:11:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,話說回來 那小子也13歲了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.87,0:11:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,一定越來越像他爸了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.45,0:11:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 塞巴斯蒂安 這是什麼語啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.94,0:11:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,西弗蘭肯語 德國南部的方言
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.16,0:11:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,這方言也太難懂了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.02,0:11:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,這我德語不是白學了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.56,0:11:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不論學什麼語言 打好基礎都很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.94,0:11:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,少爺
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.35,0:11:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,所以呢 他在說什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.64,0:11:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,「俺才不要被魔女詛咒死」
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.89,0:12:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,「恁給再多錢都白搭」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.78,0:12:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他是這麼說的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.58,0:12:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他看到了被詛咒的人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.79,0:12:08.04,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}你見過被詛咒的人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.50,0:12:11.75,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}見過！那叫一個慘不忍睹
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.34,0:12:18.47,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}臉腫成兩倍大 全身皮膚都溶解了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.88,0:12:25.60,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}其中一個當場就死了 另一個人也受了刺激 精神失常了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.73,0:12:27.68,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}有倖存者嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.31,0:12:28.89,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}有
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.81,0:12:35.32,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}聽說那人一直瑟瑟發抖 喊著「狼人來了！」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.44,0:12:36.82,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}那個人在哪裡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.40,0:12:47.41,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}他是村郊的富人家 布里格家的長子 但現在不在家裡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.25,0:12:57.46,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}政府擔心是傳染病 派人把他接到大醫院去了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.46,0:12:59.84,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}死掉的那人也一起
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.45,0:13:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,有倖存者 但精神失常了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.64,0:13:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不停喊著「狼人來了」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.07,0:13:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,難道他看到狼人了？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.86,0:13:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,政府的人把他和另一個死者一起 送去大醫院了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.42,0:13:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,要把全國的醫院找一遍嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.31,0:13:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不必了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.82,0:13:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,都精神失常了 問不出什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.10,0:13:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,還不如直接去伐烏魯夫森林
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.96,0:13:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.98,0:13:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不管出多少錢 他都不願意載我們去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.12,0:13:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,那你這麼問
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.23,0:13:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,「你的馬車賣多少錢」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.81,0:13:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,屁股好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.32,0:13:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,巴魯托 你好下流
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.02,0:13:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,可是啊 我都坐了一天多了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.87,0:13:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不過 這次難得帶上了我們啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.76,0:13:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.69,0:14:02.95,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}不好意思 麻煩把球扔過來
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.28,0:14:04.24,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.74,0:14:05.99,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}我扔了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.70,0:14:09.45,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}抱歉抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.20,0:14:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你會說德語嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.44,0:14:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,這是丹恩說的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.73,0:14:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 會一點
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.93,0:14:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.00,0:14:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,馬車已經備好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.13,0:14:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,請把行李裝上車吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.27,0:14:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡就是伐烏魯夫森林
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.46,0:14:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,太陰森了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.29,0:14:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,難怪說被詛咒了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.73,0:14:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,指南針也失靈了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.16,0:14:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,說不定地下有礦藏呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.94,0:14:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,說不定是詛咒哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.28,0:14:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼連你都這麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.24,0:14:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,您使役惡魔 結識死神
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.80,0:15:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,卻不相信詛咒 實在是奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.17,0:15:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,而且
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.95,0:15:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,連接我與您的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.99,0:15:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,也是一種詛咒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.76,0:15:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,但實際上
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.54,0:15:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,魔女只是在荒唐的審判中被誣陷的普通人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.88,0:15:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,並不會在天上飛或者召喚風暴
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.84,0:15:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,詛咒這種超自然的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.32,0:15:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,相信它才奇怪呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.48,0:15:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,…大概…吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.65,0:15:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,誰知道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.29,0:15:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,那你見過真正的魔女嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.04,0:15:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我見過幾次被稱為魔女的人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.73,0:15:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,在魔女集會上被召喚出來 被崇拜了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.81,0:15:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,召喚惡魔並加以崇拜…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.00,0:15:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我並不認為真正的集會是以此為目的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.81,0:15:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,逃避現實的成年人沉迷色慾的社交場…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.42,0:15:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,這或許才是實際情況
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.72,0:16:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,為實現願望而獻出靈魂…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.21,0:16:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,只有擁有如此覺悟 才能召喚出我們
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.70,0:16:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不過也有會隨性回應召喚的惡魔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.60,0:16:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,那你…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.28,0:16:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.48,0:16:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.67,0:16:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.97,0:16:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,少爺 請看
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.88,0:16:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,能看到建築物
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.62,0:16:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,森林裡真的有村莊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.26,0:16:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,一個人也沒有啊 是荒村嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.50,0:16:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.67,0:16:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,房屋都保養得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.70,0:16:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,可以確定有人居住
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.20,0:16:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 有人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.78,0:16:45.40,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}都出來
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.61,0:16:48.20,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}有入侵者
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.46,0:16:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好熱烈的歡迎啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.33,0:16:55.37,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}你們是什麼人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.62,0:16:57.25,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}怎麼進來的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.19,0:17:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,這個村子裡只有女人？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.72,0:17:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,而且 這是幾百年前的裝束啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.18,0:17:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,告訴她們 我想見這裡的領主
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.56,0:17:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.51,0:17:09.01,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}我們無意加害你們
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.26,0:17:12.54,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}能帶我們去見領主嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.59,0:17:13.14,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.72,0:17:14.72,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}想見領主大人？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.10,0:17:17.72,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}難道他們是衝著沙利文大人來的？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.15,0:17:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,沙利文大人？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.39,0:17:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 她們在說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.14,0:17:21.90,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}閉嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.19,0:17:23.73,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}你們該不會是…告密者？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.44,0:17:26.94,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}告密者？不是的…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.15,0:17:29.28,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}告密者別想逃
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.28,0:17:31.28,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}別以為能活著離開
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.66,0:17:35.83,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}告密者去死
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.54,0:17:38.04,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}這是在鬧什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.00,0:17:41.83,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}沙 沙利文大人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.67,0:17:46.92,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}非常抱歉 有人入侵了這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.38,0:17:49.63,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}您就是領主…沙利文大人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.97,0:17:51.59,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}正是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.30,0:17:54.80,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}我叫齊格琳德·沙利文
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.14,0:17:58.89,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}是這座森林的領主
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.63,0:18:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫齊格琳德·沙利文
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.37,0:18:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是這座森林的領主
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.44,0:18:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,這個小女孩…是領主？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.61,0:18:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你小子是哪個地盤的？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.20,0:18:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.10,0:18:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,別這樣 沃爾夫拉姆
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.85,0:18:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,痛痛痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.94,0:18:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 畢竟很久沒有外人來過了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.28,0:18:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,而且…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.41,0:18:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,怎 怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.20,0:18:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,真不知道你們是怎麼來到這裡的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.84,0:18:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,這座村莊被稱為「狼谷」
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.61,0:18:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不允許任何外人駐留
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.71,0:18:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了就快滾
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.59,0:18:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,今天就先撤退 想好對策再來
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.02,0:18:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.54,0:18:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 那我們就…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.60,0:18:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.23,0:19:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,平安穿過森林是有多幸運
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.84,0:19:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,看來你們不明白啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.58,0:19:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,此話怎講呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.74,0:19:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你們不可能不知道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.13,0:19:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,這座森林裡存在守護者 狼人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.16,0:19:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.08,0:19:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡真的是狼人守護的魔女之村嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.02,0:19:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,沃爾夫拉姆大人 他們很危險
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.75,0:19:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,必須立刻處理掉…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.55,0:19:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.21,0:19:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,大小姐 這不妥吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.36,0:19:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你不聽我的命令嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.91,0:19:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,遵命
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.12,0:19:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,聽好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.47,0:19:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,要是現在返回 不等穿出森林就天黑了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.96,0:19:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,夜晚的森林過於危險
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.70,0:19:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,無法保證你們能平安離開
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.51,0:19:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你們絕對不可能平安離開
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.42,0:20:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 今晚就破例允許你們在此過夜
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.31,0:20:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,讓你們借住一晚
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.48,0:20:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,天亮後就立刻…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.53,0:20:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,沃爾夫拉姆大人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.73,0:20:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼能讓外人進入綠之館…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.32,0:20:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,希爾黛 這是大小姐的吩咐
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.55,0:20:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,希爾黛大人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.92,0:20:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,他們說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.90,0:20:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,說是今晚能讓我們在領主府上過夜
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.37,0:20:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是大小姐的城堡 綠之館
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.04,0:20:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我來
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.24,0:20:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,一會趕我們走 一會要我們住下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.02,0:20:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,到底怎麼回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.80,0:20:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.37,0:20:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,只是…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.68,0:20:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,這座村莊…果然有內情
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.96,0:20:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡是怎麼回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.61,0:20:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,全都是刑具啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.27,0:20:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,這是懷爾德說的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.31,0:20:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那些是魔女審判的工具
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.26,0:20:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,越來越玄乎了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.05,0:20:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 那邊的矮子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.95,0:21:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你叫什麼名字
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.63,0:21:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 還沒自我介紹
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.77,0:21:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,她在問您的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.92,0:21:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫夏爾·凡多姆海伍
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.47,0:21:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,總感覺她說了很失禮的話
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.22,0:21:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,多大了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.45,0:21:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,少爺今年13歲
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.20,0:21:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,好高
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.71,0:21:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,掉下去就死定了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.38,0:21:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,到了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.09,0:21:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡就是綠之館
